\title{Technical Support Ticket: Third-Party API Integration Issue}
\author{Your Name}
\date{}

\begin{document}

\maketitle

\section*{English Version}

\subsection*{Description of the Issue}
We are experiencing an unexpected error during the integration of a third-party API into our multi-tiered system architecture. The error occurs when attempting to make a request from the application tier to the business logic tier via the integration layer. The following error message is displayed:

\verb|Error 500: Internal Server Error|

Additionally, the server logs reveal the following error:

\verb|[ERROR] Failed to process request: java.lang.NullPointerException: apiIntegrationService is null|

This issue has been observed across multiple instances of the application and appears to affect all users. We believe this issue may be due to a misconfiguration of the API integration service or a problem with the communication between the application tier and the business logic tier.

\subsection*{Root Cause Analysis}
